    "body": "**Describe the bug**\nWhen you click anywhere in the frequency input, it opens the dropdown. However, when you click on the icon, it does not open it. However, in other dropdowns, this works as expected.\n\n**To Reproduce**\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\n\n1. Go to an encounter\n2. Add medication\n3. Try clicking on the icon of the frequency input\n\n**Expected behavior**\nIt should open the dropdown even when clicked on icon.\n\n**Screenshots**\n\n<img width=\"1276\" height=\"394\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1af8c6af-590c-46bd-b738-3036bb0a7037\" />\n\n",
